{
    "$comment": "Setup Assistant deep links (docs/research/design-review-onboarding.md section 2), verified 2026-10-11; gcp.errorGroup (the crash reports page, CR-M2c-15) added 2026-10-18 in the console's documented errors/detail/{groupId} form, checked by the next weekly run, which opens an issue when it does not resolve. {name} placeholders are filled at run time; `sample` holds the values the weekly contract check (scripts/ci/check_contracts.py, .github/workflows/contract.yml) uses. Only verified links belong here.",
